Package: qualitas
Type: Package
Title: General Data Quality Assessment with Rules, Scores and Reports
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Geoffrey", "Manda", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "geofmanda@gmail.com", comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0001-8104-5021"))
Description: Assesses the quality of any rectangular data set against a
    data specification that can be inferred from the data or written by the
    user. More than thirty checks cover structure, completeness, uniqueness,
    validity, consistency, plausibility, relational integrity, timeliness,
    fabrication and confidentiality. Each check is mapped to ISO/IEC 25012,
    the harmonised terminology of Kahn et al. (2016) <doi:10.13063/2327-9214.1244>
    and the framework of Schmidt et al. (2021) <doi:10.1186/s12874-021-01252-7>.
    Every finding is reported with its row, column and value; every measure
    as a numerator, a denominator and a ratio in the form of Pipino, Lee and
    Wang (2002) <doi:10.1145/505248.506010>. Results feed a cleaning log
    that can be applied and re-assessed, and are written as an HTML or Word
    report, a JSON file or tidy tables.
